            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid [block comments are not supported](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/6be765891c95242f6b8ebd3a25aa285ab3e9f6de/doc/mini-comment.txt#L21). This is mostly due to lack of a robust way to get information about buffer's style of block comments (if any).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I am afraid <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/6be765891c95242f6b8ebd3a25aa285ab3e9f6de/doc/mini-comment.txt#L21\">block comments are not supported</a>. This is mostly due to lack of a robust way to get information about buffer's style of block comments (if any).</p>",
            "bodyText": "I am afraid block comments are not supported. This is mostly due to lack of a robust way to get information about buffer's style of block comments (if any).",
